      "audio_format": null,
      "audio_script_gold": null,
      "channel_effects": null,
      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Hi there! I need some help with a few exchanges and a cancellation from my recent orders. I’d like to swap my kid’s bicycle for one with a larger frame size—switching to a mountain bike is fine. Also, I want to exchange the jigsaw puzzle from the same order for one with the same difficulty but with 1000 more pieces, and I’d prefer an art-themed puzzle over an animal one if possible.\n\nAdditionally, I’d like to exchange my camera for a model with slightly lower resolution, but I want to keep all the other features the same. For both exchanges, I’d like to use my Visa card for any payments or refunds.\n\nLastly, I need to cancel just the skateboard from one of my orders. Can you help me with all of this?",
      "cost": 0.0023299999999999996,
      "generation_time_seconds": null,
      "is_audio": false,
      "is_final_chunk": true,
      "role": "user",
      "source": null,
