    {
      "audio_format": null,
      "audio_script_gold": null,
      "channel_effects": null,
      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Yes—I can help, but first I need to authenticate you.\n\n1) **Please share the email address on your account** (preferred).  \n   *If you can’t share email, tell me your **first name + last name + ZIP code**.*\n\n2) Please also provide the **order ID(s)** for each request (it helps me verify which ones are *pending* vs *delivered*):\n   - **Kid’s bicycle / puzzle**: which **order #**?\n   - **Camera exchange**: which **order #**?\n   - **“Cancel just the skateboard”**: which **order #**?\n\n3) For the “Visa” preference: when I look up your payment methods, I’ll select your **Visa** for any payments/refunds.  \n   - If you have **more than one Visa** on your account, tell me which one (e.g., last 4 digits).\n\nAfter you send the email/name+zip and the order IDs, I’ll check each order’s status and confirm what exchanges/cancellation are possible.",
      "cost": 0.00427923,
